OL,4,CTeenage girl stabbed multiple times by 
OL,5,C14-year-old boy, murder trial told     
OL,6,GA teenage girl was stabbed "around 55  
OL,7,Gtimes" by a 14-year-old boy, a murder  
OL,8,Gtrial has been told.                   
OL,10,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau   
OL,11,FGwent, left home at about 18:30 on 20  
OL,12,FJune, telling her father she was       
OL,13,F"popping out for a bit".               
OL,15,FHer body was discovered face down in   
OL,16,Fwoodland close to Duffryn Park two     
OL,17,Fdays later.                            
OL,19,FA 14-year-old boy, who cannot be named 
OL,20,Fbecause he is under 18, denies her     
OL,21,Fmurder.                                
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
