OL,4,C'Show-off' driver jailed for crash     
OL,5,Cwhich killed one and injured two       
OL,6,GA driver has been jailed for nine      
OL,7,Gyears after "showing off" in his high- 
OL,8,Gperformance Mercedes, leading to a     
OL,9,Gcrash which killed one passenger and   
OL,10,Gleft two others with life-threatening  
OL,11,Ginjuries when it exploded on a         
OL,12,Gmotorway near Heathrow airport.        
OL,14,FAadil Sabir, 31, from Cardiff, "shot   
OL,15,Foff like a rocket" after a road block  
OL,16,Fwas lifted by traffic police following 
OL,17,Fan earlier collision on the M4, on 29  
OL,18,FOctober 2023.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
