OL,4,CBritain's Got Talent winner almost     
OL,5,Cmissed audition due to Carphone        
OL,6,CWarehouse shift                        
OL,7,GBritain's Got Talent winner Paul Potts 
OL,8,Gsaid he nearly missed his life-        
OL,9,Gchanging audition on the show because  
OL,10,Ghe had been unable to get time off     
OL,11,Gfrom his job managing a phone shop.    
OL,13,FThe tenor shot to fame in 2007 after   
OL,14,Fperforming Nessun Dorma on the ITV     
OL,15,Ftalent show, but had unsuccessfully    
OL,16,Ftried to change the date of his        
OL,17,Fperformance because of his shift at    
OL,18,FPort Talbot's Carphone Warehouse.      
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
