OL,4,CBurnham does not view Wales as an      
OL,5,Cequal nation, claims first minister    
OL,6,GThe first minister says he wants an    
OL,7,Gurgent meeting with the prime minister 
OL,8,Gafter Andy Burnham rejected calls to   
OL,9,Ggive more powers to the Welsh          
OL,10,Ggovernment.                            
OL,12,FRhun ap Iorwerth said he was "deeply   
OL,13,Fdisappointed" and that Burnham "does   
OL,14,Fnot view Wales as an equal nation".    
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Welsh Labour leader Ken     
OL,17,FSkates urged Burnham to "negotiate     
OL,18,Faround a table" with ap Iorwerth.      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
